  m_Name: TutorialMapDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: 
  sentences:
  - You can look at your adventurer map by pressing <sprite name="keys-Sheet_19">
    or <sprite name="keys-Sheet_9">.
  - If you want to remember where you found an item, you can select a pin and place
    it down on the map with Left Click.\nTo remove a pin, press Right Click on top
    of it.
